'''Chroma Snow Dagger''' is a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] that was obtainable by unboxing the [[2025 Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2025]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has ended.

== Appearance ==
It has the same appearance as Snow Dagger, but with alternating colors. 

== Trivia ==
* It partners with the godly gun [[Chroma Snowcannon]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Chroma Snow Set|Chroma Snow Set]].
* It is the chroma counterpart of  the godly knife under the name [[Snow Dagger]].

